&lt;p&gt;As a Project Manager at Motive, you&#39;ll lead the delivery of one of our largest and most complex integrated programs—a global internal conference for a major commerce brand that brings together stakeholders from around the world. Working across strategy, creative, content, environmental design, production, digital, and client teams, you&#39;ll help orchestrate every moving piece that transforms an ambitious vision into an exceptional live experience.&lt;/p&gt;
