&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qba73j&quot; data-start=&quot;1532&quot; data-end=&quot;1622&quot;&gt;Build and manage master project plans that coordinate dozens of concurrent deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kbucfp&quot; data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1739&quot;&gt;Drive alignment across multiple client teams and agency disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xbyv3f&quot; data-start=&quot;1740&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Coordinate dependencies between content development, experience design, production, and event execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ofr1h2&quot; data-start=&quot;1847&quot; data-end=&quot;1941&quot;&gt;Manage approvals, decision logs, and evolving priorities while maintaining project momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ouvmwg&quot; data-start=&quot;1942&quot; data-end=&quot;2043&quot;&gt;Identify project risks early and develop mitigation plans for complex, high-visibility initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b9301q&quot; data-start=&quot;2044&quot; data-end=&quot;2139&quot;&gt;Partner with senior client stakeholders to establish priorities, timelines, and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7b2z8s&quot; data-start=&quot;2140&quot; data-end=&quot;2242&quot;&gt;Ensure all workstreams remain connected while balancing competing deadlines and business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
