&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 - 5 years of experience at a creative agency desired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Superb communication skills with an emphasis in mediation and conflict management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly responsive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mhqyd6&quot; data-start=&quot;2910&quot; data-end=&quot;2940&quot;&gt;Event or conference planning experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build relationships and effectively engage with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amazing organization skills and attention to detail while adhering to fast turnaround and tight deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multi-task and manage a variety of projects simultaneously with multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
