&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Motive has a clear vision: to be a creative leader where a diverse mix of talented people want to come, to stay and do their best work. We know our company succeeds only through the hard work and dedication of our passionate and creative employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Motive is a dynamic agency and creative collective operating at the speed of culture. We’re a collective of deep thinkers, creative makers, cultural connoisseurs, and executional aces. We create meaningful engagements between brands and their audiences, cultivating relationships that drive tangible results for our clients. And we do it with sharp strategy and powerful creative, executed across all the media and touch-points key to our targets’ lives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As pioneers in the area of content, digital engagement, and innovative experiential programs, and award winners for work in TV, event, digital and social, Motive has created a culture where every individual is given an opportunity to stretch and flex their creative and executional muscles daily. We are a team of hard-working, fast-moving, energetic, passionate, driven, straight-talking creative thinkers. We like being challenged and we love the collaboration necessary to overcome the challenges and succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like a place you would thrive, let’s see if we can make something happen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SR. PRODUCER, BRAND EXPERIENCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid position, meaning you&#39;re empowered to work from home and our local office location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time we are currently only interviewing candidates based in the Chicago and Denver markets.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Motive’s Brand Experience business is growing — and we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Producer&lt;/strong&gt; who knows how to turn ambitious creative ideas into incredible real-world experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for a seasoned, hands-on producer who can take a project from &lt;strong&gt;“what if we…” to doors open&lt;/strong&gt; — owning the budgets, timelines, vendors, fabrication, logistics and million little details that bring an experience to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work alongside our creative, strategy and account teams to produce everything from immersive brand experiences and cultural activations to live events, fan experiences, sampling tours and large-scale builds. We need someone who can see around corners, solve problems before they become problems, confidently lead partners and vendors, and stay remarkably calm when the inevitable curveball gets thrown onsite.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You might be our person if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have 7+ years of experiential / live event production experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have independently produced complex, high-visibility brand experiences from concept through execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Know your way around production budgets, scopes, timelines, fabrication, permitting, vendors and onsite operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Can translate a big creative vision into a smart, executable production plan&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are comfortable being client-facing and collaborating across creative, strategy and account teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Know when to push for the idea — and when production realities require a smarter solution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are equal parts &lt;strong&gt;detail-obsessed operator, creative problem solver and get-it-done human&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don’t panic when Plan A becomes Plan D somewhere between load-in and doors open&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is a LOT happening inside Motive’s Brand Experience studio right now, and even more ahead. We’re building, growing and taking on increasingly ambitious work — which makes this a pretty exciting moment to join the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sound like you — or someone you know? &lt;strong&gt;Come build some cool stuff with us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
