&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Motive recruits, employs, trains, compensates and promotes regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law. The starting salary for this position is between $80k and $95k annually, based on experience and location. We offer an inspiring working environment and great benefits, including low-cost health, dental, and vision plans; unlimited paid time off, 401k with annual match, an employee stock ownership program and more.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
